Source: majoris-login-resources
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Majoris contributors <maintainers@majoris.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson, libglib2.0-dev, python3, python3-tinycss2
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: majoris-login-resources
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, gdm3, gnome-shell (>= 48.7), dconf-cli, fontconfig
Description: Majoris native GDM and lock-screen presentation resources
 Prototype-derived St theme, precomposited wallpapers, symbolic assets and
 Plus Jakarta Sans fonts. Full layout requires the separately rebuilt,
 version-validated Majoris GNOME Shell packages. No authentication service
 or browser is installed. Stock Shell ignores these private resources.
